{"id": "UgwwGmV48X6aRQ3JnBl4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 23, "text": "リアルタイムで遊べたのも幸せ…なんだな", "published": "2026-05-30T12:42:46", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwwGmV48X6aRQ3JnBl4AaABAg.AXR9Abt18n5AXcz-VM3yCW", "parent": "UgwwGmV48X6aRQ3JnBl4AaABAg", "likes": 1, "text": "もうあの感動体験は出来ませんもんね", "published": "2026-06-04T12:15:16", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
{"id": "UgxENjCNeJ0GIE5kUK54AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "当時はレベル上げしながらよく眠り落ちてました。\nクロノトリガーって脳が癒される楽曲が多いなと思う。画像もだけど。", "published": "2026-05-28T17:37:20", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxENjCNeJ0GIE5kUK54AaABAg.AXMXIIsBgcqAXcz9L8BarY", "parent": "UgxENjCNeJ0GIE5kUK54AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "あの世界観と音楽の組み合わせは本当に癒されますよね、共感してくださって嬉しいです♪", "published": "2026-06-04T12:16:36", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
